Replaces: krdp (>= 6.6.80~), kde-config-krdp, krdp-console-test, krdp-virtual-test
Description: Farside RDP server with console and retained desktops
 Farside shares a Plasma Wayland desktop over RDP with H.264 (AVC420/AVC444)
 video, audio, microphone, camera and clipboard redirection.
 .
 Farside adds the physical-console host (farside-console-host and
 farside-console-worker), which keeps one RDP transport across the SDDM greeter
 and the seat0 Plasma session, and the retained virtual-desktop broker
 (farside-virtual-host) with its guardian, PAM keeper and cleanup helpers.
 Both system services are installed disabled. It bundles a patched private
 KPipeWire in /usr/lib/<triplet>/farside that does not replace the system one.
